  "observations": [
    "Dependency graph includes manifests/locks and submissions; GHES lacks dependency-license and dependent calculations in this fragment.",
    "Automated premerge tests are good practice, not claimed executed checks.",
    "Default three-day cooldown applies only to version updates, not security updates.",
    "Actions alerts are described for semantic-version references, not SHA references; this is distinct from security-update support.",
    "Dependency-scope table preserves runtime defaults and filename/test-specific development classification; no observed dependency inventory.",
    "Alert filters preserve product/version conditions, source-local sorting and EPSS probability versus percentile.",
    "YAML grouping overrides UI configuration; security and version grouping sets must be separately named.",
    "Deletion, registry credentials and rule mutation instructions remain inert source evidence."
